# ==================================
# VERSION CONTROL
# ==================================
.git
.gitignore
.github
.gitattributes

# ==================================
# IDE FILES (never needed in Docker)
# ==================================
.idea
.vscode
.settings
.project
.classpath
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# ==================================
# BUILD ARTIFACTS (will be rebuilt in Docker)
# ==================================
target/
build/
out/
bin/

# ==================================
# MAVEN WRAPPER (not needed if using Maven in Docker)
# ==================================
.mvn/
mvnw
mvnw.cmd

# ==================================
# DOCUMENTATION (not needed at runtime)
# ==================================
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE
docs/
*.md

# ==================================
# TESTS (not needed in production image)
# ==================================
src/test/
**/test/
**/*Test.java
**/*IT.java
test-results/
coverage/

# ==================================
# CI/CD
# ==================================
.github/
.gitlab-ci.yml
.travis.yml
Jenkinsfile
azure-pipelines.yml

# ==================================
# DOCKER FILES (don't copy Docker into Docker)
# ==================================
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
*.dockerfile

# ==================================
# LOGS
# ==================================
*.log
logs/
log/

# ==================================
# OS FILES
# ==================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ==================================
# TEMPORARY FILES
# ==================================
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ==================================
# ENVIRONMENT FILES (use Docker env vars instead)
# ==================================
.env
.env.*
*.env

# ==================================
# SCRIPTS (usually not needed in container)
# ==================================
scripts/
*.sh
*.bat
*.ps1

# ==================================
# MEDIA FILES (if large and not needed)
# ==================================
# Uncomment if you have large assets not needed in production
# *.mp4
# *.avi
# *.mov
# *.wmv

# ==================================
# MISC
# ==================================
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.cache
.gradle
```

---

## 🎯 **Why You Need Both**

### **Example Scenario:**
Your project has:
├── target/                  # Maven build output (2GB)
├── .idea/                   # IntelliJ files (500MB)
├── src/test/                # Test files (100MB)
├── logs/                    # Application logs (50MB)
└── .env                     # Secret credentials